{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026abC8D68gEH1793100562.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>乒乓總會訓練中心正式啟用，目標培育新一代接班人。</p><p></p><p>總會主席余國樑、總教練李靜，榮譽顧問、前國家代表張怡寧等，主持開幕儀式。位於沙田的訓練中心，由乒總自行營運，是首個專業訓練基地。</p><p></p><p>設有三個訓練館、發球機及「鷹眼」訓練系統等，目標是為具潛質球員提供更優質的訓練，培育港隊新一代接班人。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T12:42:07.871443+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":141,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T11:27:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T20:38:17.974675+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T12:38:23.964742+00:00","content_hash":"f6384f5c5652eb14aed9b5bfb8c93ab4fc823ddc61e3cba84ee75ec8aa34f39f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}